s390/mm: Remove cpu_has_idte()

jira KERNEL-1864
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-6.12.0-264.7.1.el10_3
commit-author Heiko Carstens <hca@linux.ibm.com>
commit 220d8e10d69a30db7d9cbd0d3483a739768ed16c
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-6.12.0-264.7.1.el10_3/220d8e10.failed

Remove cpu_has_idte(). The IDTE instruction is part of the
Dat-Enhancement facility 1, which is always available.
Therefore remove the helper and now superfluous code.

	Acked-by: Alexander Gordeev <agordeev@linux.ibm.com>
	Reviewed-by: Claudio Imbrenda <imbrenda@linux.ibm.com>
	Signed-off-by: Heiko Carstens <hca@linux.ibm.com>
(cherry picked from commit 220d8e10d69a30db7d9cbd0d3483a739768ed16c)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

